{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "4095f58b53158e93694bf119f6fcee596332c85a88f320e8dd6c08df2eedf41e", "ja": "続きはCMの後で！", "zh": "精彩内容稍后广告回来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "091ec609d9448b95e014b3953e7009b469694a96af7220459749e528b2d020a0", "ja": "ついに本番撮影、まずは新商品の実食から。\n各々自信作を出し、紬＆風花チームが接戦を\n制した！　……と、盛り上がるスタジオの陰\nで、プロデューサーが番組ディレクターから\nある取引を持ち掛けられていて……？", "zh": "终于开始正式拍摄，首先要进行新品试吃。\n大家拿出了各自的得意之作，紬＆风花队\n在激烈角逐中胜出！……与此同时，在气氛\n热烈的摄影棚一角，制作人正被节目导演\n提出一桩交易……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_05_1000_p", "source_sha256": "823155ce27e85bd54e32945a03f061ec1985c490fccf70fdd38c10b0c1958dfe", "ja": "（いよいよ番組本番の収録が始まる！　今回は公演衣装\nでの二日間撮影、今日はスタジオでの前半戦だ）", "zh": "（终于要开始正式录制节目了！这次要穿着公演服装拍摄两天，今天是在摄影棚进行前半场拍摄。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_05_1001_meibutsushikai", "source_sha256": "4cba3b6826d79c466c5fa00ad648426a9d1b202c47dc4144e1812369b51098ac", "ja": "さて、今夜はお弁当対決！　という事でまずは……\n新商品の実食！　それぞれのチーム、いかがですか？", "zh": "那么，今晚就是便当对决！首先要进行的是……\n试吃新商品！各位队伍觉得怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_05_1002_041fuk", "source_sha256": "16354712638d0b1d365aee8e14ed374abc90e169152612b65911c8db865ecf32", "ja": "はい！　最高のお弁当ができたと思います。これ以上の\nものは、現時点ではちょっと思いつかないです……。", "zh": "是的！我觉得我们做出了最棒的便当。现阶段，我实在想不出比这更好的了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_05_1003_051tmg", "source_sha256": "b4bb55be367b78c91b8efe5f59d8e00c4261a718c91dafad962864fc0823af3f", "ja": "ええ。店長さんからお預かりした、大切なお弁当……。\n負けるわけにはいきません。必ず勝ちます！", "zh": "是的。这是店长先生托付给我的重要便当……  \n我不能输。一定会赢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_05_1004_wakategeinin", "source_sha256": "b1232177980b91914ac1015f26bcdad910a5efe55ec4a90a2d10ddfa2feb4287", "ja": "熱いな～自分ら。\nホカホカやん。お弁当なだけに。", "zh": "你们还真热血啊～  \n热乎乎的嘛，毕竟是便当。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_05_1005_013hib", "source_sha256": "310ff4c5b9bc8f4f9e65f3f3982f03ee417d42ad55d0f096b53d4c366a192a81", "ja": "ふふーん！　なかなかの迫力だね、紬、風花！\nでも、自分達だって絶対に負けないぞ！", "zh": "哼哼！真是气势十足呢，紬、风花！不过，我们这边也绝对不会输的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_05_1006_023aka", "source_sha256": "3b1c7df70fd262809e3ada823a0f7dbcb62c7e9db30f78256f531b083b863442", "ja": "茜ちゃん達の新商品は、まさにカンペキな一品！\nつむりん、風花ちゃん……悪いけど勝たせてもらうよ！", "zh": "小茜他们的新商品，真是完美无缺的一品！\n小紬、风花……不好意思，这次就让我们赢吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_05_1007_meibutsushikai", "source_sha256": "effa49b7c29b6d3c2614bfd7027d645c6dcc2fbc480de074c00c28a268863a80", "ja": "おーっと……両チーム、どちらもアツアツですね！\nさて、それでは早速、実食といきましょか！", "zh": "哎呀……两队都是热火朝天呢！\n那么，接下来就马上开始品尝吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_05_1008_meibutsushikai", "source_sha256": "670d05001066d51f21d58669336a9403b695cc930fd9b5fd082aeaf5c1c852e3", "ja": "まずは……『響＆茜チーム』から！　どうぞ！", "zh": "首先是……“响＆茜队”！请！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_05_1009_013hib", "source_sha256": "55387157f35239f7beef278f757026c40b5f79e7708fdd7b0879d00073bc6812", "ja": "オッケーさ！　自分達のお弁当は……じゃーん！\n沖縄のソウルフード、タコライスだぞ！", "zh": "没问题！我们准备的便当是……锵——！\n冲绳的灵魂美食，塔可饭！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_05_1010_023aka", "source_sha256": "d50e4edb0e44d5a1da829f7c5a4010d418cb217b3cb43939910b551eb0c7909b", "ja": "なんと、茜ちゃんの顔型のキャラ弁なのだ～！\n見た目も味も満点ってこと！　ささ、召し上がれ♪", "zh": "没想到，还是小茜脸型的角色便当呢～！\n外观和味道都是满分！来来，请享用♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_05_1011_oogosho", "source_sha256": "0ab1df89ed37da6c30d46c7c6e33864cd76a1ff8b93baddb50aeaa0a7b4a0978", "ja": "うーん？　まあ、確かに見た目はええな。\nけどタコライスなんて、年寄りの舌には……", "zh": "嗯——？确实，卖相挺不错的。\n不过塔可饭这种东西，对老年人的口味来说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_05_1012_oogosho", "source_sha256": "7fd52ad899b311031ba2caa6eaa844aaa24cfbf6fb50c5f2203832ce37d7265b", "ja": "美ンンンッ味アアァーィイッ！？！？！？", "zh": "美——味啊啊啊——！？！？！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_05_1013_wakategeinin", "source_sha256": "0639747b89d48828ab1f86571e8dab8d3aa2293eaa860c994944960495cd993a", "ja": "ピリ辛のサルサと濃厚なチーズが、\nお口の中で溶け合って……ハーモニーやん！", "zh": "微辣的莎莎酱和浓郁的奶酪在口中交融……简直太和谐了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_05_1014_013hib", "source_sha256": "a5088f663e7cd8d97a96c8f4a49520453b11125ae7e1dd0b6edad825b4abe736", "ja": "えへへっ！　ポイントはひき肉の味付けだぞ。\n和風のそぼろにしてあるから、ご飯がすすむでしょー！", "zh": "诶嘿嘿！关键在于肉末的调味哦。做成了日式肉末，配着米饭很下饭吧——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_05_1015_meibutsushikai", "source_sha256": "9e4dd5ccfb8cf19acc6ba0e4e3ca03924199492e70358b3667c250ac40fcd1bf", "ja": "おーっと、これは好感触！　二番手の\n『紬＆風花チーム』は大丈夫でしょうか？　どうぞ！", "zh": "哦——这感觉不错！第二组的\n“紬＆风花队”没问题吧？有请！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_05_1016_041fuk", "source_sha256": "15d8c7673d2b41d1026c827db30a77a22313da444f8f0b9f1d7180a0a2146f77", "ja": "はい！　私たちが用意したお弁当は……こちら！\n幕の内弁当です♪", "zh": "好的！我们准备的便当是……这个！\n是幕之内便当♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_05_1017_051tmg", "source_sha256": "251bd3430d36dfb3dbda1894e425fe2b1e5b469d3ac49b7437c36523ba4ac6fb", "ja": "菜飯に、鮭の塩焼き、卵焼き……ボリューム\nたっぷりで、栄養バランスもよく、オススメです。", "zh": "菜饭、盐烤三文鱼、鸡蛋卷……分量十足，\n营养均衡，非常推荐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_05_1018_051tmg", "source_sha256": "668a38e3b5735812edb8dce29720d9ba249d2673f829ee0b3c775d71e77619ad", "ja": "どうぞ、お召し上がりくださいまし。", "zh": "请用餐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_05_1019_wakategeinin", "source_sha256": "fb0999c72bca3bbab588389e014eadda9e2571e753fcf1bcb8bcfc885d0344d6", "ja": "え……待って待って、ホンマに普通の幕の内やん！\nなんや、今さらこんなん出されても……。", "zh": "诶……等等等等，这还真就是普通的幕之内便当嘛！\n真是的，现在才拿出这种东西来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_05_1021_023aka", "source_sha256": "57c4eb8985b76374be87da4299014087a67f36ee25bb1d6279446cdd2c883e07", "ja": "え？　な、なんかあの芸人さん、\n動かなくなっちゃったけど……どうしたのかニャ！？", "zh": "诶？那、那个艺人好像不动了……这是怎么回事喵！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_05_1022_013hib", "source_sha256": "b2e4cae0ee44f87da1de716bed1925b93d2d8dd4cad9f5b3b2cefc8c9b963e63", "ja": "み、見て、茜！　あれは……泣いてるっ！？", "zh": "快、快看，茜！那是在……哭吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_05_1023_wakategeinin", "source_sha256": "8eadd611105765949dbc58a520c7be74fdcdfcf8cb83f9d35688e6de207cab1d", "ja": "なんでや……なんで涙が……？\nなんや、子どもの頃の事、思い出してしもて……。", "zh": "为什么啊……为什么会流泪……？\n怎么回事，我想起小时候的事了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_05_1024_051tmg", "source_sha256": "dc32e87ad807e2769c79ecc9c6cf91b6b5cbbbba78808b6dfb34a1efb57e3d5a", "ja": "こちらの店長さんは、元は割烹の料理人ですから、\n得意料理はやはり和食だそうです。", "zh": "听说这家店的店长原本是做割烹料理的厨师，所以拿手菜果然还是和食。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_05_1025_041fuk", "source_sha256": "27eb01f9fa1222004b872dfb11e30fada97baf24ddd843be80f3ba4e45291845", "ja": "そして、そのお弁当を作るため……店長さんの\nお子さん達に、好きなおかずを選んでもらいました。", "zh": "而为了做出那份便当……我让店长的孩子们选了自己喜欢的配菜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_05_1026_051tmg", "source_sha256": "82a67c058ba21f5bc7b0df8b4b9ef253b0bb15ba12e8262b6be08afbdd5e0497", "ja": "つまりそれは、店長さんの得意料理の中でも、\nお子さん達への愛情が詰まった料理ばかりなのです！", "zh": "也就是说，这些全都是店长拿手菜中，满载着对孩子们的爱的料理！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_05_1027_oogosho", "source_sha256": "0da7f2af9ea8fa3dea21e8501ece95aeadd593cab2a459a93cf009a08c9f0f60", "ja": "うっま、これ……うっま……。", "zh": "好吃，这个……好吃……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_05_1028_wakategeinin", "source_sha256": "2eab6570284ba2e2dcb7ad33432c9148e11b5a311a0c966bc7759b9eb6a36551", "ja": "師匠……リアクション、忘れてるで！", "zh": "师父……你忘了做反应啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_05_1029_051tmg", "source_sha256": "8cdd84667c2c07c06c1617ba7a81dbb7024f7cc13ed94466f08a380d471439e1", "ja": "ふう……どうにか、アピールはやり切りましたね。\n後はただ、結果を待つだけ……。", "zh": "呼……总算把拉票完成了。\n接下来只要等待结果……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_05_1030_meibutsushikai", "source_sha256": "8a56f2991dc1cc3262433de6315347009bea3352f8681e4170ef9bdf20df045e", "ja": "はいっ！　では一戦目、投票結果が揃いました。\nえー、ポイントで上位を獲得したのは……", "zh": "好！那么，第一场的投票结果已经出炉了。\n呃，按得分取得前几名的是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_05_1031_meibutsushikai", "source_sha256": "aa489e42f370f45af4ca1dbff45bf70c1b96cc9138245ccc3e9759c0cbd81509", "ja": "『紬＆風花チーム』！　一歩リードです！", "zh": "“紬＆风花队”！领先一步！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_05_1032_051tmg", "source_sha256": "267f1a2e0cfda28c47874dce698d2b0e920169523ce12fc9baf1485ecd37ccbe", "ja": "っ！　豊川さん！", "zh": "啊！丰川小姐！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_05_1033_041fuk", "source_sha256": "8c3b376d09fdf624754135f191db3f1b4ddb4f206e95a08321c360fd718cce8b", "ja": "紬ちゃん！　やったね！", "zh": "紬！成功了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_05_1034_023aka", "source_sha256": "1c218a7b6e85045f7d6b726440aabb551ab909c9858e913bc7a10ba6c748aa18", "ja": "くぅーっ……悔しい！　けど、\nまだ負けたわけじゃないから！　勝負はここからだよ！", "zh": "呜——好不甘心！可是，\n还不能说我们已经输了！胜负从现在才开始！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_05_1035_013hib", "source_sha256": "9a44d8d9647d5f582b1c995775a32abe16b8c7f53f600fdd5c618eb8f5bafe5d", "ja": "そうだぞ！　次は自分達が取るからね！\n茜、すぐに帰って、社長ちゃんと作戦会議さ～！", "zh": "就是嘛！下一场我们一定会拿下！茜，赶紧回去，和社长开作战会议啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_05_1036_p", "source_sha256": "046ba0eb9d40c910914e23df14706048ceef39b0129c790ca889cb40a2a26de5", "ja": "（ふぅ、手に汗握る勝負だったな……！\nこの分だと明日も、白熱した戦いになりそうだ）", "zh": "（呼，真是一场让人捏一把汗的较量啊……！\n照这样下去，明天似乎也会是一场激烈的战斗。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_05_1037_bangumidirector", "source_sha256": "6f68c1511d7f655f0793cc039744543cc0e6daf41ccbfe35f909173d508860a3", "ja": "765プロさん、お疲れ様でした！\nいや～、よかったですよ。いい感じにドラマもあって。", "zh": "765事务所各位，辛苦了！\n哎呀～，表现得很棒哦。戏剧性也很足，感觉真不错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_05_1038_p", "source_sha256": "27837fde82cd4502898bbfd9934f10df2a9899c898cb19be8dfb7d14b7cf3dbf", "ja": "あ、ディレクターさん！　ありがとうございます。\nそう言っていただけると……。", "zh": "啊，导演先生！谢谢您。\n您能这么说……我就……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_05_1039_bangumidirector", "source_sha256": "03fce11d1697a904c29d36794ccaaf26f2c121b79d1a29d79ffcc2dfc87ef2b5", "ja": "それで、明日の決着……急な話ですんませんけど、\nこちらの用意した台本でお願いできません？", "zh": "所以，关于明天的决胜……虽然说得有点突然，但能请您按照这边准备的剧本来吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_05_1040_p", "source_sha256": "199386484db5aa49f6df26b82f2a6d9e04d59c3f2053bc11561553faeade366a", "ja": "はぁ……え？　台本って……え？", "zh": "哈啊……诶？剧本……诶？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_05_1041_013hib", "source_sha256": "3af6d04842ec9a4000ab64214937a2fd3fab7c4a766a3daed53adf08c8943567", "ja": "{$P$}、お疲れさま！\n……って、あれ？　どうしたんだ？　ボーッとして。", "zh": "{$P$}，辛苦了！\n……咦？怎么了？发什么呆呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_05_1042_051tmg", "source_sha256": "726368fcef2d0696fa7309c7d904f5df21f22fd724e343267bb9bd0b2918e0be", "ja": "{$P$}？\nあの……どこか具合でも悪いのですか？", "zh": "{$P$}？\n那个……您是哪里不舒服吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_05_1043_p", "source_sha256": "545f657ca4b3229d40e3f46157db34360f3c1a5deff1c57c95becdd27919bcd7", "ja": "あ……ああ、ゴメン、いや……なんでもない。", "zh": "啊……啊，抱歉，不……没什么。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_05_1044_041fuk", "source_sha256": "a5fb64279bc4999ca69daed5b85dac713fbaa0f5e02bab3924469b60e3732ce4", "ja": "本当に大丈夫ですか？　無理しちゃ\nダメですよ？　何かあったらすぐ言って下さいね！", "zh": "真的没事吗？可别勉强自己哦？\n要是有什么事，一定要马上告诉我！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_05_1045_023aka", "source_sha256": "c50dbdd585d699ee33ccd3665610170b506450195daecb1dad12f3066ec7bcdb", "ja": "精神的な疲れだったり、とか？\nどうする？　茜ちゃん人形あるけど、モフモフする？", "zh": "比如说是精神上的疲劳之类的？怎么办？我这里有小茜人偶，要不要摸摸它？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
